-- =====================================================================
--  G-SMaRT HRIS : complete database WITH DEMO DATA, database version 21
--  Company database + multi-company MASTER database, in one file
--  Target: MySQL 5.5.3 or newer (also MySQL 5.6 / 5.7 / 8.x, MariaDB 5.5+)
--  Generated: 2026-11-11 20:29
--
--  WHAT IT CONTAINS
--   1. The company database `nbjihris`: every table of version 21 with the reference
--      data (statutory tables SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG and tax, leave types,
--      transaction codes, holidays, settings, roles and permissions of every page)
--      and the DEMO DATA of Sample Holdings Corporation: 3 companies / branches,
--      10 departments, 4 shifts, 15 employees with their 201 files, user accounts,
--      biometric logs and daily time records August 1 to September 18, 2026,
--      approved August cutoffs and 7 payroll runs, leaves, loans and ledgers,
--      evaluations, disciplinary cases and a retroactive step increase.
--   2. The master database `nbjihrismaster`: the multi-company tables (companies,
--      Company Codes, memberships, Super Admin accounts, linked accounts, logs),
--      empty. On the first page load the application registers `nbjihris` as
--      Company 1 with its Company Code, maps its user accounts for sign-in and
--      creates the Super Admin account of config/config.php (super_admin_username
--      / super_admin_password).
--   Other company databases (nbjihris_company_002, nbjihris_company_003 ...) are created by the Super Admin
--   (Create Company); they are not part of this file.
--
--  !! IT DROPS AND RE-CREATES EVERY TABLE OF BOTH DATABASES. Do not import it over
--  !! databases with live data (use database/upgrade_to_v21_mysql55.sql there).
--
--  DATABASE NAMES
--   Company database : `nbjihris`         (the 2 lines marked COMPANY DATABASE NAME)
--   Master database  : `nbjihrismaster`   (the 2 lines marked MASTER DATABASE NAME)
--   Later companies  : `nbjihris_company_002`, `nbjihris_company_003` ... (made by Create Company)
--   config/config.php of this install MUST have these three lines, or the
--   application would use the default `ihris_master` of your other HRIS:
--     'db_name'           => 'nbjihris',
--     'master_db_name'    => 'nbjihrismaster',
--     'company_db_prefix' => 'nbjihris_company_',
--   It never touches `ihris`, `ihris_master` or `ihris_company_...`.
--
--  HOW TO IMPORT
--   Command    : mysql -u root -p < nbjihris_full_v21_demo_mysql55.sql
--   phpMyAdmin : Import tab > choose this file > Go (no database selected)
--   The MySQL account of config/config.php needs every right on both databases
--   (and CREATE to add companies), e.g.
--     GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON *.* TO 'youruser'@'localhost';
--
--  DEMO ACCOUNTS
--   admin / admin123 (asked to change on first sign-in), hr / hr123,
--   payroll / payroll123, supervisor / super123, director / director123,
--   pedro / pedro123, employee / employee123, emp-0006 ... emp-0015 / Welcome123
--   Super Admin: the username and password set in config/config.php.
--   Change every password before using the system with real data.
-- =====================================================================

